abstract: >-
  An MCP server for the Lambda Cloud API: GPU prices, live capacity,
  cheapest-available lookup, and env-gated launch/restart/terminate behind a
  required hourly price cap. Read-only by default; write tools are hidden from
  the agent unless LAMBDA_MCP_ALLOW_WRITE=1. Not affiliated with Lambda.
